      "task_summary": "Find Re(z) and Re(1/z) for z = 3^{i-1}, giving answers in the form p cos(ln q) where p, q ∈ ℤ+.",
      "primary_topic": "number_algebra.complex_numbers",
      "secondary_topics": [
